  "overview": "The Napa County Sheriff's Office uses Flock Safety's Operating System to capture objective evidence without compromising on individual privacy. Napa County Sheriff's Office utilizes retroactive searches to solve crimes after they've occurred. Additionally, Napa County Sheriff\u2019s Office utilizes real-time alerting of hotlist vehicles to capture wanted criminals. In an effort to be open with the public to demonstrate our proper usage and communicate what guardrails are in place, we have made the below policies and usage statistics available to the public.\n\nCommunity Impact\nData & Usage Summary",
